      "control_name": "Model Package Must Have a Traceable Creator",
      "control_description": "A SageMaker model package must have a traceable creator identity (UserProfileArn or DomainId in the CreatedBy field). Without creator attribution, there is no audit trail linking the model to the person or pipeline that produced it — incident response cannot determine who trained the model or from what environment.\n",
